          "content": "LANDSCAPE INVENTORY:\nSystems: corp.itsm, emarsys.cx, my.mes (Manufacturing Execution), sap.ariba, sap.crm, sap.ehs, sap.odm, sap.s4, sap.sf, siemens.plm, workday.hcm\n\nPURCHASE ORDER & PROCUREMENT:\nAPI: sap.ariba:apiResource:PurchaseOrderNetworkAPI:v1 \u2713 BEST for establish POs and contractual terms\nAgent: sap.s4:agent:ProcurementMatchingAgent:v1 \u2713 for cost impact analysis using historical pricing & vendor metrics\nAgent: sap.ariba:agent:SupplierComplianceAndIncidentMonitor:v1\nAgent: sap.ariba:agent:VendorInvoiceReconciliationAutomation:v1\n\nPRODUCT LAUNCH VENDOR COMPLIANCE PROCESS:\nAgent: sap.s4:agent:BOMComplianceAutomationAgent:v1 \u2713 Part of ProductLaunchVendorCompliance process (step 1)\n- Validates BOM against supplier qualifications\n- Workflow: BOMCompliance \u2192 Material/Vendor selection \u2192 Cost Impact calculation \u2192 Invoice validation\nAPI: sap.ariba:apiResource:PurchaseOrderNetworkAPI:v1 \u2713 Part of ProductLaunchVendorCompliance (PO/contract finalization)\n\nMANUFACTURING EXECUTION & CAPACITY PLANNING:\nAgent: my.mes:agent:ProductionChangeOrchestrator:v1 - handles \"schedule-machines\", \"sequence-work-orders\", manufacturing execution orchestration\nAPI: my.mes:apiResource:EquipmentOEEAnalytics:v1 - provides equipment performance metrics & predictive maintenance insights (NOT capacity planning)\n\nWORKFORCE SAFETY & COMPENSATION:\nAgent: sap.sf:agent:OccupationalSafetyComplianceMonitor:v1\nAgent: sap.ehs:agent:IncidentResponseCoordinator:v1\n\nENGINEERING & CHANGE MANAGEMENT:\nAgent: siemens.plm:agent:EngineeringChangeAndMaterialProvisioning:v1\nAgent: siemens.plm:agent:BOMComplianceValidator:v1\nAgent: siemens.plm:agent:SupplierQualificationAndMaterialCoordinator:v1\n\nNOTE: Landscape lacks specific capacity planning agent that integrates equipment readiness, workforce availability, and maintenance scheduling. ProductionChangeOrchestrator is closest but focuses on change orchestration not capacity planning.\n"
